  "sourceData": {
    "answer": "to{} to:repeat/do-something-over-again",
    "mnemonic": "<ja>繰る</ja> is \"to spin\" (so spinning) and <ja>返す</ja> is \"to return\" (so returning). Put them together and you have something that's spinning and returning to the same spot over and over. Something that does that is repeating itself, making this <vocabulary>to repeat</vocabulary> or <vocabulary>to repeat over and over</vocabulary>.",
    "readingMnemonic": "The readings come from <ja>繰る</ja> and <ja>返す</ja>. Combine them together to get the reading."
